WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Estimated savings, with owner review time included. All history shown is synthetic demo data.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Start with an everyday request, such as preparing a customer order from your menu.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
The proposed action stops in staging and waits for the owner's decision.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
The owner edits and approves. Trial mode records the result without performing the operation.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
Review how the request was handled and check the estimated AI usage cost.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
Explore help with customer calls, orders, stock alerts, expense records and daily summaries.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
Choose the services you need and add your business details, catalog and preferences.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
Your menu, opening hours and stock thresholds keep proposed actions relevant to your business.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
Compare estimated staff time with review time and AI cost. Export the trial report as a PDF.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Gluons: a little AI, a lot more time. Explore the working demo or request a free trial.
